2025-06-21 18:32:40,570 - INFO - [templates_crud:425] - Raw templates details: [{'template_id': 1, 'template_name': 'SAV Ticket Ouvert (FR)', 'template_type': 'email_sav_ticket_opened', 'description': 'Email envoyé quand un ticket SAV est ouvert.', 'base_file_name': 'sav_ticket_opened_fr.html', 'language_code': 'fr', 'is_default_for_type_lang': 1, 'category_id': 58, 'content_definition': None, 'email_subject_template': 'Ticket SAV #{{ticket.id}} Ouvert - {{project.name | default: "Référence Client"}}', 'email_variables_info': None, 'cover_page_config_json': None, 'document_mapping_config_json': None, 'raw_template_file_data': b'<!DOCTYPE html>\n    <html>\n    <head><title>Ticket Ouvert</title></head>\n    <body>\n        <p>Bonjour {{client.contact_person_name}},</p>\n        <p>Votre ticket de support SAV #{{ticket.id}} concernant le produit \'{{product.name | default: "N/A"}}\' (Projet: {{project.name | default: "N/A"}}) a bien \xc3\xa9t\xc3\xa9 ouvert.</p>\n        <p><strong>Description du probl\xc3\xa8me :</strong></p>\n        <p>{{ticket.issue_summary}}</p>\n        <p>Notre \xc3\xa9quipe va examiner votre demande prochainement.</p>\n        <p>Cordialement,<br/>L\'\xc3\xa9quipe {{seller.company_name}}</p>\n    </body>\n    </html>\n', 'version': None, 'created_at': '2025-06-14T17:47:22.629207Z', 'updated_at': '2025-06-14T17:47:22.629207Z', 'created_by_user_id': None, 'client_id': None}, {'template_id': 2, 'template_name': 'SAV Ticket Résolu (FR)', 'template_type': 'email_sav_ticket_resolved', 'description': 'Email envoyé quand un ticket SAV est résolu.', 'base_file_name': 'sav_ticket_resolved_fr.html', 'language_code': 'fr', 'is_default_for_type_lang': 1, 'category_id': 58, 'content_definition': None, 'email_subject_template': 'Ticket SAV #{{ticket.id}} Résolu - {{project.name | default: "Référence Client"}}', 'email_variables_info': None, 'cover_page_config_json': None, 'document_mapping_config_json': None, 'raw_template_file_data': b'<!DOCTYPE html>\n    <html>\n    <head><title>Ticket R\xc3\xa9solu</title></head>\n    <body>\n        <p>Bonjour {{client.contact_person_name}},</p>\n        <p>Bonne nouvelle ! Votre ticket SAV #{{ticket.id}} ({{ticket.issue_summary}}) a \xc3\xa9t\xc3\xa9 r\xc3\xa9solu.</p>\n        <p><strong>D\xc3\xa9tails de la r\xc3\xa9solution :</strong></p>\n        <p>{{ticket.resolution_details}}</p>\n        <p>Nous esp\xc3\xa9rons que cette solution vous convient. Si vous avez d\'autres questions, n\'h\xc3\xa9sitez pas \xc3\xa0 nous recontacter.</p>\n        <p>Pour nous aider \xc3\xa0 nous am\xc3\xa9liorer, veuillez prendre un moment pour nous laisser un avis : <a href="{{app.google_maps_review_url}}">Laissez un avis ici</a>.</p>\n        <p>Cordialement,<br/>L\'\xc3\xa9quipe {{seller.company_name}}</p>\n    </body>\n    </html>\n', 'version': None, 'created_at': '2025-06-14T17:47:22.845293Z', 'updated_at': '2025-06-14T17:47:22.845293Z', 'created_by_user_id': None, 'client_id': None}, {'template_id': 3, 'template_name': 'Suivi Prospect Proforma (FR)', 'template_type': 'email_follow_up_prospect', 'description': 'Email de suivi pour un prospect ayant reçu une proforma.', 'base_file_name': 'follow_up_prospect_fr.html', 'language_code': 'fr', 'is_default_for_type_lang': 1, 'category_id': 59, 'content_definition': None, 'email_subject_template': 'Suite à votre demande de proforma : {{project.name | default: client.primary_need}}', 'email_variables_info': None, 'cover_page_config_json': None, 'document_mapping_config_json': None, 'raw_template_file_data': b'<!DOCTYPE html>\n    <html>\n    <head><title>Suite \xc3\xa0 votre demande</title></head>\n    <body>\n        <p>Bonjour {{client.contact_person_name}},</p>\n        <p>Nous faisons suite \xc3\xa0 votre demande de proforma concernant le projet/produit \'{{project.name | default: client.primary_need | default: "votre demande r\xc3\xa9cente"}}\'.</p>\n        <p>Avez-vous eu l\'occasion d\'examiner notre proposition ? N\'h\xc3\xa9sitez pas si vous avez la moindre question ou si vous souhaitez discuter des prochaines \xc3\xa9tapes.</p>\n        <p>Cordialement,<br/>{{seller.personnel.sales_person_name | default: seller.company_name}}<br/>{{seller.company_name}}</p>\n    </body>\n    </html>\n', 'version': None, 'created_at': '2025-06-14T17:47:22.954696Z', 'updated_at': '2025-06-14T17:47:22.954696Z', 'created_by_user_id': None, 'client_id': None}, {'template_id': 5, 'template_name': 'Vœux Nouvelle Année (FR)', 'template_type': 'email_greeting_newyear', 'description': 'Email de vœux pour la nouvelle année.', 'base_file_name': 'greeting_holiday_newyear_fr.html', 'language_code': 'fr', 'is_default_for_type_lang': 1, 'category_id': 60, 'content_definition': None, 'email_subject_template': 'Bonne Année {{doc.current_year}} ! - {{seller.company_name}}', 'email_variables_info': None, 'cover_page_config_json': None, 'document_mapping_config_json': None, 'raw_template_file_data': b"<!DOCTYPE html>\n    <html>\n    <head><title>Bonne Ann\xc3\xa9e</title></head>\n    <body>\n        <p>Cher/Ch\xc3\xa8re {{client.contact_person_name}},</p>\n        <p>Toute l'\xc3\xa9quipe de {{seller.company_name}} vous pr\xc3\xa9sente ses meilleurs v\xc5\x93ux pour la nouvelle ann\xc3\xa9e !</p>\n        <p>Que celle-ci vous apporte succ\xc3\xa8s, sant\xc3\xa9 et prosp\xc3\xa9rit\xc3\xa9.</p>\n        <p>Cordialement,<br/>L'\xc3\xa9quipe {{seller.company_name}}</p>\n    </body>\n    </html>\n", 'version': None, 'created_at': '2025-06-14T17:47:23.193356Z', 'updated_at': '2025-06-14T17:47:23.193356Z', 'created_by_user_id': None, 'client_id': None}, {'template_id': 4, 'template_name': 'Vœux Noël (FR)', 'template_type': 'email_greeting_christmas', 'description': 'Email de vœux pour Noël.', 'base_file_name': 'greeting_holiday_christmas_fr.html', 'language_code': 'fr', 'is_default_for_type_lang': 1, 'category_id': 60, 'content_definition': None, 'email_subject_template': 'Joyeux Noël de la part de {{seller.company_name}}!', 'email_variables_info': None, 'cover_page_config_json': None, 'document_mapping_config_json': None, 'raw_template_file_data': b"<!DOCTYPE html>\n    <html>\n    <head><title>Joyeux No\xc3\xabl</title></head>\n    <body>\n        <p>Cher/Ch\xc3\xa8re {{client.contact_person_name}},</p>\n        <p>En cette p\xc3\xa9riode de f\xc3\xaates, toute l'\xc3\xa9quipe de {{seller.company_name}} vous souhaite un Joyeux No\xc3\xabl et une excellente fin d'ann\xc3\xa9e !</p>\n        <p>Nous esp\xc3\xa9rons vous retrouver en pleine forme pour de nouveaux projets.</p>\n        <p>Meilleurs v\xc5\x93ux,<br/>L'\xc3\xa9quipe {{seller.company_name}}</p>\n    </body>\n    </html>\n", 'version': None, 'created_at': '2025-06-14T17:47:23.095293Z', 'updated_at': '2025-06-14T17:47:23.095293Z', 'created_by_user_id': None, 'client_id': None}, {'template_id': 6, 'template_name': 'Message Générique (FR)', 'template_type': 'email_generic_message', 'description': 'Modèle générique pour communication spontanée.', 'base_file_name': 'generic_message_fr.html', 'language_code': 'fr', 'is_default_for_type_lang': 1, 'category_id': 61, 'content_definition': None, 'email_subject_template': 'Un message de {{seller.company_name}}', 'email_variables_info': None, 'cover_page_config_json': None, 'document_mapping_config_json': None, 'raw_template_file_data': b"<!DOCTYPE html>\n    <html>\n    <head><title>{{email.subject_custom}}</title></head>\n    <body>\n        <p>Bonjour {{client.contact_person_name}},</p>\n        <div>{{email.body_custom}}</div>\n        <p>Cordialement,<br/>L'\xc3\xa9quipe {{seller.company_name}}</p>\n    </body>\n    </html>\n", 'version': None, 'created_at': '2025-06-14T17:47:23.356852Z', 'updated_at': '2025-06-14T17:47:23.356852Z', 'created_by_user_id': None, 'client_id': None}]
